This branch preserves the project's pre-repository history: old app builds,
planning notes, research scripts, QA material and evidence screenshots. It is
kept for the maintainer's records. No license is granted for anything on this
branch: you may view it on GitHub, but you may not copy, redistribute, modify
or use it commercially. Game facts themselves belong to no one.

